      "statement": "In the FogSim sealed campaign for scenario \"USA vs RUS - sourced personnel, illustrative\" (SIMULATED, seeded from the graded order of battle), the modal outcome across the declared run set is \"blue_holds\".",
      "resolution": "Resolved from the executed FogSim reveal for this scenario (fogsim_reveal_oob.json in this repository) read on 2026-12-31: YES if the most frequent outcome across revealed runs equals \"blue_holds\". This scores a MODEL, not a war.",
